<source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357380/extras/95e3e6aea52ba5ce412da968307ad1be.webm?t=1747642640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357380/extras/95e3e6aea52ba5ce412da968307ad1be.mp4?t=1747642640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise in real-time combat and fight the shadow monsters plaguing the land. Swap between different characters to adapt to enemies and gain the upper hand, and keep ahead of the swarm with new equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357380/extras/a6da03c413c136932eea88f48ddc7506.poster.avif?t=1747642640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357380/extras/a6da03c413c136932eea88f48ddc7506.webm?t=1747642640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357380/extras/a6da03c413c136932eea88f48ddc7506.mp4?t=1747642640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, troubled world and learn the secrets of its past as you travel across the land. Discover the truth of the Shadow War and meet memorable characters in a great adventure to restore light to the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
